      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "I read with interest your article on asthma support for children 'Breathing new life into asthma care' (features, April 20). Your readers might find useful a new website from Chest Heart & Stroke Scotland (CHSS), My Lungs My Life ( www.mylungsmylife.org ). It has sections for people with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, people with asthma and parents or guardians of children with asthma."},
